      {"sno":4,"unit":"IV","finks_dimension":"Foundational Knowledge","task":"Follow ONE real listed company whose product you use (a two-wheeler, a soap, a bank) on the stock exchange for one week.","deliverable_notes":"Its price on five dated days (your own table) + one news event you think moved it. The dated price table is the deliverable."},
      {"sno":5,"unit":"V","finks_dimension":"Caring","task":"Find ONE real trade association / self-help group / cooperative in your town or family (a weavers' society, a farmers' FPO) and learn what it does for a named member.","deliverable_notes":"The named association + one real benefit it gives a named member. Bring a photo or a document if the member shares one."}
