      {"option_no":2,"title":"The Same Thermal Quantity, Two Ways","primary":"Measure ONE thermal quantity by TWO lab methods on the same specimen. Bring both results, your hand-drawn graphs, honest error analysis.","support":"~400 words on why they differ and which you'd trust.","llc":"Present both; let the cohort probe your discrepancy."},
